# org-target: docs/10-19-design/10-architecture/10.19-standard-identities-and-aitia-review-traceability.org::#authority-order-approval-pending-packets
# render-layout: elk; theme: 0; pad: 24; timeout: 30
direction: down
classes: {
  owner: {style.fill: "#E6F5F3"; style.stroke: "#19756C"; style.border-radius: 10}
  design: {style.fill: "#EAF2FF"; style.stroke: "#315B8A"; style.border-radius: 10}
  boundary: {style.fill: "#FFF2DD"; style.stroke: "#9B6C25"; style.border-radius: 10}
}
input: "DESIGN / existing native Aitia review owners\nSame Profile, criterion requests and trusted verification adapter\nExplicit missing premise and actual governing policy\nNo new status, history service or fallback authority" {class: design}
authority: "AA05 / unavailable archive status\nAuthentic historical archive remains evidence\nAH-current still requires applicable status witness\nTimeout is neither denial nor current approval\nPermitted exact status witness can close only its own premise" {class: design}
order: "PR07 / unknown revocation-use order\nC0 before both R and U; R versus U unresolved\nKnown effect and current revocation remain facts\nBoth U-before-R and R-before-U histories remain possible\nCurrent false validity cannot reconstruct past ordering" {class: design}
approval: "OH07 / required old-owner approval absent\nKeep original assignment, obligation and actual acceptance\nWilling recipient is not missing approval\nNo authorized fallback in the established policy boundary\nUnknown authority inventory also supplies no permission" {class: design}
oracle: "DESIGN / independent missing-premise judgment\nAuthority/status fact table / compatible causal histories\nActual duty, approver, fallback and acceptance matrix\nPreserve partial evidence and seek the exact missing input\nA counter needs independently established contrary facts" {class: design}
native: "EXISTING native content-verification boundary\nNo successful verification -> no new matching receipt\nP8 can be structurally present while content remains unverified\nA current registered criterion fail is a separate blocking branch\nOld receipts may still admit old inputs; no automatic external lookup" {class: owner}
result: "DESIGN GOLD / not executed\nPending is scoped to dependent completion or authority claims\nValid history, source evidence and proof content remain reusable\nNew evidence -> shared recovery contract 10.20 / view 90.75\nActual outage, order and governance controls still need tests" {class: boundary}
input -> authority
input -> order
input -> approval
authority -> oracle
order -> oracle
approval -> oracle
oracle -> native -> result
